WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.380
A prince is sent into
the forest for 14 years,

2
00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:05.640
to keep his father's promise.

3
00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:08.730
A village boy among
cowherds steals butter,

4
00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.870
and lifts a mountain to
shelter the villagers.

5
00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.460
Many Hindus worship
both, Rama and Krishna,

6
00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.870
as God in a form on earth.

7
00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:21.080
So why would God come
down as a prince in exile,

8
00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:23.760
or a cowherd who steals butter?

9
00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:26.790
In this mission, you'll
follow Rama through exile,

10
00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:29.800
war and a painful choice as king.

11
00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:33.630
Then you'll meet Krishna as
child, flute-player and teacher,

12
00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:37.410
and see why many Hindus
love him as God himself.

13
00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:40.870
Your mission: find out
why, in Hindu belief,

14
00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:44.360
God would come down as a
prince in exile or a cowherd.
